        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d) Prerequisite skill qualifications, where required in certain classifications, shall be described in the Classification of Work and Wages. To be eligible for assignment to such a classification, an employee must possess and satisfactorily demonstrate such prerequisite skill qualifications in the manner specified in the classification prior to advanced assignment. Where licenses are a prerequisite skill, the employee must exhibit possession of such license before placement on advanced assignment.",
